{"nodes": [{"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "label": "Week 01: inbound lead triage and routing", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L1-L51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "60 hand-labelled leads. Jev routed 90.0% correctly against Sonnet 5's 78.3% and Haiku 4.5's 53.3%, at 366 ms p50 and $0.042 per 1,000 leads against Sonnet's 2,571 ms and $3.006. Jev binned 0 of 16 funded buyers where Haiku binned 7, and ran about 7 times faster and 70 times cheaper than the closest Claude model on quality."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_six_step_triage_workflow", "label": "Six-step inbound lead triage workflow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L3-L15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Steps 1 to 4 (disqualify, icp_fit, segment, intent) are judgments and go to a model. Step 5, the queue, is a rule and runs in code for every runner. Step 6, the first email, is writing and goes to Claude because Jev cannot write."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_thinking_disabled_correction", "label": "Fairness correction: extended thinking disabled", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L59-L63", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Claude CLI enables extended thinking by default. Haiku spent about 1,800 thinking tokens and 22 seconds per lead working out whether a resume was a resume. MAX_THINKING_TOKENS=0 took the same call to 2.6 seconds. Nobody would ship lead triage with thinking on, so benchmarking it that way would have been dishonest by a factor of 23."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_prompt_cache_pricing_correction", "label": "Fairness correction: prompt-cache-aware pricing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L65-L68", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sonnet's CLI caches the system prompt, so its real token count lands in cache_creation and cache_read instead of input_tokens. Cache reads were being charged at full input price. Cache writes bill at 1.25x and reads at 0.1x, and Claude now gets credit for that."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_overhead_calibration_correction", "label": "Fairness correction: CLI token-overhead calibration", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L70-L74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Because of the caching, the calibration probe read the wrong field and measured Sonnet's CLI scaffolding as 2 tokens instead of 2,214, so Claude was billed for a prompt it did not write. Fixing it dropped Sonnet's cost per thousand from $7.71 to $3.01."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_split_call_ablation", "label": "Split-call ablation (one Claude call per question)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L80-L99", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Run to answer the objection that asking four questions at once strawmanned Claude. Haiku's 29 icp_fit errors all ran the same direction and lined up with 27 over-disqualifications. Four calls per lead lifted icp_fit from 51.7% to 71.7% and route accuracy from 53.3% to 61.7% and nearly halved the Brier score, at 5.2 times the latency and 2.9 times the cost, and still lost to Jev by 28 points."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_partial_run_warning", "label": "Do not read the partial run", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L97-L99", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "At 18 leads the split run sat at 88.9% and looked like it had closed the gap. At 60 leads it was 61.7%."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_intent_optimism_bias", "label": "Jev's half-level intent optimism bias", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L103-L108", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Intent is Jev's worst number at 75% against Sonnet's 82%. Of 15 errors, 14 are off by exactly one level and all run the same way: it reads leads as keener than they are. The bias is consistent enough that a threshold shift fixes it, and until then the intent score should go to a human review queue."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_competitor_blind_spot", "label": "Jev's competitor blind spot (L009 Clay, L010 Apollo.io)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L110-L136", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jev's two disqualify misses were a RevOps manager at Clay and a PM at Apollo.io, waved through at 0.06 and 0.18. Naming the competitor set in round 2 flipped both for Sonnet (0.95 and 0.97) and moved Jev only to 0.27 and 0.23: Jev applies the rubric it is given and does not know who the companies are. A competitor check is a domain lookup against a list the CRO already keeps, so it belongs in code."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_step_6_email_writing", "label": "Step 6: write the first-touch email", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L138-L185", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jev has three question types (choice, score, noul) and no text type, and asking for one returns HTTP 400, so Sonnet writes the emails conditioned on Jev's judgments. 29 of 60 leads earned one at a mean of 4,052 ms and $0.0026 each. One of them went to L009, the Clay competitor Jev let through."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_end_to_end_cost_model", "label": "End-to-end cost per 1,000 inbound leads", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L165-L174", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jev triage with Sonnet writing costs $1.31 per 1,000 leads against $4.28 for Sonnet doing both, 3.3x cheaper end to end. The saving grows the worse the inbound is, because junk never reaches the expensive step."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_signature_leak", "label": "Email quirks: em dashes and a CLI signature leak", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L176-L181", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The prompt says no em dashes and 10 of the 29 emails have one anyway, so house style needs post-processing. The emails are signed with a name that was never in the prompt, so the CLI is leaking something from the environment. Neither affects the triage numbers."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_recommended_architecture", "label": "Recommended production architecture (blocklist, Jev, route in code, Sonnet writes)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L187-L212", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A domain blocklist goes first because it is the one step with a right answer that needs no model. Jev takes the four fuzzy judgments at 366 ms and $0.042 per 1,000. Routing stays in code: five branches, free, instant and unit-testable. Only qualified leads reach Sonnet. Jev's Brier score of 0.041 against Sonnet's 0.130 means its probabilities can drive the flow: send everything over 0.9 straight through and queue the 0.4 to 0.6 band for a human."}, {"id": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_instead_of_api_caveat", "label": "Claude through the CLI instead of the API (duration_api_ms, scaffolding subtracted)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L245-L249", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "There was no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY on the benchmark machine, so Claude ran through the claude CLI. Latency is duration_api_ms, which excludes process startup, and token counts have the measured CLI scaffolding subtracted. Both choices favour Claude, and wiring in an API key should move the numbers slightly further in Claude's favour."}], "edges": [{"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_rubric_rubric", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L17-L18", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_six_step_triage_workflow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L3-L15", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_spec", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L76", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "target": "results_results", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L17-L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_build_dataset_main", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L218", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_bench_main", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L219-L220", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_split_runner_main", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L221", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_step6_email_main", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L222", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_score_main", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L223", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_week_01_lead_triage", "target": "src_bench_sequential_execution", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L228-L229", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_six_step_triage_workflow", "target": "src_spec_disqualify_question", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L5-L6", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_six_step_triage_workflow", "target": "src_spec_icp_fit_question", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L7", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_six_step_triage_workflow", "target": "src_spec_segment_question", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L8", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_six_step_triage_workflow", "target": "src_spec_intent_question", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L9", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_six_step_triage_workflow", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_spec_route", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L10-L14", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_six_step_triage_workflow", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_step_6_email_writing", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L11-L15", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_six_step_triage_workflow", "target": "readme_decisions_vs_writing_split", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L13-L15", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_step_6_email_writing", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_step6_email_prove_jev_cannot_write", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L143-L147", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_step_6_email_writing", "target": "src_step6_email_jev_has_no_text_primitive", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L140-L147", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_thinking_disabled_correction", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_claude_runner_clauderunner_invoke", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L59-L63", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_prompt_cache_pricing_correction", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_claude_runner_input_cost", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L65-L68", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_prompt_cache_pricing_correction", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_claude_runner_pricing", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L67-L68", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_overhead_calibration_correction", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_claude_runner_clauderunner_calibrate", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L70-L74", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_overhead_calibration_correction", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_prompt_cache_pricing_correction", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L70-L72", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_split_call_ablation", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_split_runner_claudesplitrunner", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L87-L89", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_split_call_ablation", "target": "src_split_runner_error_correlation_hypothesis", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L82-L85", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_partial_run_warning", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_split_call_ablation", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L97-L99", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_intent_optimism_bias", "target": "src_spec_intent_question", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L103-L108", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_intent_optimism_bias", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_jev_runner_intent_label", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L106-L108", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_intent_optimism_bias", "target": "week_02_deal_risk_readme_jev_severity_bias", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L103-L108", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_competitor_blind_spot", "target": "src_spec_competitor_clarification", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L115-L118", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_competitor_blind_spot", "target": "src_score_competitors_leaked", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L110-L113", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_competitor_blind_spot", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_rubric_disqualify_rule", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L110-L111", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_recommended_architecture", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_spec_route", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L191-L203", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_recommended_architecture", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_score_brier", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L205-L209", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_recommended_architecture", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_intent_optimism_bias", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L211-L212", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_recommended_architecture", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_competitor_blind_spot", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L198-L199", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_end_to_end_cost_model", "target": "src_step6_email_qualified_only_gating", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L165-L166", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_end_to_end_cost_model", "target": "results_results", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L168-L174", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_signature_leak", "target": "src_step6_email_system", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L176-L178", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_signature_leak", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_step_6_email_writing", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L176", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_instead_of_api_caveat", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_claude_runner_clauderunner_invoke", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L245-L246", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_instead_of_api_caveat", "target": "week_01_lead_triage_src_claude_runner_clauderunner_run", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L246-L247", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_instead_of_api_caveat", "target": "readme_fix_the_unfair_thing", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md", "source_location": "L247-L249", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "benchmark_fairness_corrections", "label": "Claude-favouring fairness corrections applied before publishing", "nodes": ["week_01_lead_triage_readme_thinking_disabled_correction", "week_01_lead_triage_readme_prompt_cache_pricing_correction", "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_overhead_calibration_correction", "week_01_lead_triage_readme_cli_instead_of_api_caveat", "readme_fix_the_unfair_thing"], "relation": "form", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "week-01-lead-triage/README.md"}]}